stateDiagram-v2
[*] --> LocalMetadata
LocalMetadata --> RemoteCreated: create
RemoteCreated --> Uploading: payload/cache miss
RemoteCreated --> RemoteValid: cache hit validated
Uploading --> RemoteValid: upload complete
RemoteValid --> Resident: scheduled/use
Resident --> RemoteValid: evicted from VRAM but resource valid
RemoteValid --> Readback: CPU observation required
Readback --> RemoteValid
RemoteValid --> Destroyed
Destroyed --> [*]
